        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion CL-S7, Modern Callista Lever with Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is what is known as a power piece. It is the kind of leverset that whole rooms are decorated around. The inspiration for modern apartments in every big city (or least it should be). The Callista Lever with Square Rose has something to say: \"I'm the highest paid employee in this firm\" and \"I am a powerful person who commands respect\". If you don't hear it, you don't love beautiful, modern hardware the way we do. And that's fine, because you do not have to spend your whole day looking at door levers to know that the Callista Leverset should be the gear stick in a sports car. Just look at it and know that the black composite inlay in the brushed nickel lever (also available in polished chrome) is just what your home office needs to look official. It is sleek, beautiful, and powerful--the perfect adornment for both modern offices and homes. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion CL-S7 Callista Leverset with Contemporary Square Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>\"Positive Stop\" lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Callista Lever With Black Inlay:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid brass or bronze with black composite inlay.</li>\r\n<li>Wood:  Plantation grown teak</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
